{"3983090": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Soap Slide", "steam_appid": 3983090, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Roadmap</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983090/extras/5fd14a81f67c50562ca499a713815f28.avif?t=1787331828\" width=1024 height=576 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soap Slide is a party game played on physics‑based tracks, playable solo or with friends. Speed, angle and fluid interactions are at the core: find the right move, slide your soap and climb the leaderboards. Key themes: physics‑based gameplay, multiplayer experience and leaderboards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983090/extras/8caab882f8c9a474f9787e23f12658c0.poster.avif?t=1787331828\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983090/extras/8caab882f8c9a474f9787e23f12658c0.webm?t=1787331828\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983090/extras/8caab882f8c9a474f9787e23f12658c0.mp4?t=1787331828\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983090/extras/1c5c29d07e743d246e189cb12ad38f72.poster.avif?t=1787331828\" width=1170 height=96 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983090/extras/1c5c29d07e743d246e189cb12ad38f72.webm?t=1787331828\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983090/extras/1c5c29d07e743d246e189cb12ad38f72.mp4?t=1787331828\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Slippery Physics Chaos</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accelerate, bounce and collide with soap characters; comical wipeouts and unexpected outcomes make every run fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983090/extras/1bd52ba6b4decd2a2d6dbed9fe4c84dc.poster.avif?t=1787331828\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983090/extras/1bd52ba6b4decd2a2d6dbed9fe4c84dc.webm?t=1787331828\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983090/extras/1bd52ba6b4decd2a2d6dbed9fe4c84dc.mp4?t=1787331828\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mini Games &amp; Modes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soap Slide offers special modes so every session feels like a different experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983090/extras/a8c066624c6a9bd77cfc18aa99b4ec1e.poster.avif?t=1787331828\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983090/extras/a8c066624c6a9bd77cfc18aa99b4ec1e.webm?t=1787331828\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983090/extras/a8c066624c6a9bd77cfc18aa99b4ec1e.mp4?t=1787331828\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Single or Multiplayer</strong></h2><p class=\"b